{"crc":"2765e937","kind":"Candidate","payload":{"response":"Looking at the issue, the problem is that `limit_choices_to` on a ForeignKey can render duplicate options in form fields when using Q objects with joins. The fix needs to add `.distinct()` to the queryset when applying `limit_choices_to`.\n\nLet me examine the relevant code in `apply_limit_choices_to_to_formfield`:\n\n# path: django/forms/models.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\ndef apply_limit_choices_to_to_formfield(formfield):\n    \"\"\"Apply limit_choices_to to the formfield's queryset if needed.\"\"\"\n    if hasattr(formfield, 'queryset') and hasattr(formfield, 'get_limit_choices_to'):\n        limit_choices_to = formfield.get_limit_choices_to()\n        if limit_choices_to is not None:\n            formfield.queryset = formfield.queryset.complex_filter(limit_choices_to)\n=======\ndef apply_limit_choices_to_to_formfield(formfield):\n    \"\"\"Apply limit_choices_to to the formfield's queryset if needed.\"\"\"\n    if hasattr(formfield, 'queryset') and hasattr(formfield, 'get_limit_choices_to'):\n        limit_choices_to = formfield.get_limit_choices_to()\n        if limit_choices_to is not None:\n            formfield.queryset = formfield.queryset.complex_filter(limit_choices_to).distinct()\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"producer":{"instance":"01KZT2KBEWH44D5PYRSPZQRJF8","kind":"drafter","parent":"01KZT2KBEP6E441DHDS147214M"},"schema":"Candidate@1","seq":14,"t":1786507813.023017}
{"crc":"6743d5ce","kind":"substrate.TriggerFired","payload":{"factory":"validator","firing_key":null,"input_sha256":"sha256:cc154519d79ea68308e4346446e512b630f51312a7f159d77c993f2e5b2a1b72","instance":"01KZT2KR4ZGRZVN0GWFFA2F07H","resolved_input":{"response":"Looking at the issue, the problem is that `limit_choices_to` on a ForeignKey can render duplicate options in form fields when using Q objects with joins. The fix needs to add `.distinct()` to the queryset when applying `limit_choices_to`.\n\nLet me examine the relevant code in `apply_limit_choices_to_to_formfield`:\n\n# path: django/forms/models.py\n<<<<<<< SEARCH\ndef apply_limit_choices_to_to_formfield(formfield):\n    \"\"\"Apply limit_choices_to to the formfield's queryset if needed.\"\"\"\n    if hasattr(formfield, 'queryset') and hasattr(formfield, 'get_limit_choices_to'):\n        limit_choices_to = formfield.get_limit_choices_to()\n        if limit_choices_to is not None:\n            formfield.queryset = formfield.queryset.complex_filter(limit_choices_to)\n=======\ndef apply_limit_choices_to_to_formfield(formfield):\n    \"\"\"Apply limit_choices_to to the formfield's queryset if needed.\"\"\"\n    if hasattr(formfield, 'queryset') and hasattr(formfield, 'get_limit_choices_to'):\n        limit_choices_to = formfield.get_limit_choices_to()\n        if limit_choices_to is not None:\n            formfield.queryset = formfield.queryset.complex_filter(limit_choices_to).distinct()\n>>>>>>> REPLACE","round":1,"slot":0},"trigger_id":"validate"},"producer":null,"schema":"substrate.TriggerFired@1","seq":15,"t":1786507813.0231512}
